{"title": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The six phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变</span>", "slides": [{"id": "c5-phase-changes:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🌡️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Phase Changes &amp; Energy</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相变与能量</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The six phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Frost appears on a car window overnight without ever being liquid water — which of the six phase changes is that?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一夜之间，车窗上结了霜，中间从来没有变成过液态水——这是六种相变中的哪一种？</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●○○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 20 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The six phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">s→l melting · l→s freezing · l→g evaporation · g→l condensation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固→液 熔化 · 液→固 凝固 · 液→气 汽化 · 气→液 液化</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">s→g sublimation · g→s deposition (both skip the liquid)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固→气 升华 · 气→固 凝华（都跳过液态）</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">All are physical changes. Toward gas absorbs energy; away from gas releases it.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">都是物理变化。朝气态吸收能量；离开气态放出能量。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 330\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phase changes\"><defs><marker id=\"pta\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"arw\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"142.7\" y1=\"228.9\" x2=\"238.6\" y2=\"97.3\" class=\"pt-a\" marker-end=\"url(#pta)\"/><line x1=\"227.3\" y1=\"89.1\" x2=\"131.4\" y2=\"220.7\" class=\"pt-a\" marker-end=\"url(#pta)\"/><line x1=\"377.3\" y1=\"228.9\" x2=\"281.4\" y2=\"97.3\" class=\"pt-a\" marker-end=\"url(#pta)\"/><line x1=\"292.7\" y1=\"89.1\" x2=\"388.6\" y2=\"220.7\" class=\"pt-a\" marker-end=\"url(#pta)\"/><line x1=\"156.0\" y1=\"255.0\" x2=\"364.0\" y2=\"255.0\" class=\"pt-a\" marker-end=\"url(#pta)\"/><line x1=\"364.0\" y1=\"269.0\" x2=\"156.0\" y2=\"269.0\" class=\"pt-a\" marker-end=\"url(#pta)\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"lbl s\">↗ <tspan class=\"en\">sublimation</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 升华</tspan></text><text x=\"158\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"lbl s\">↙ <tspan class=\"en\">deposition</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 凝华</tspan></text><text x=\"362\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">evaporation</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 汽化</tspan> ↖</text><text x=\"362\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">condensation</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 液化</tspan> ↘</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">melting</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 熔化</tspan> →</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"298\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\">← <tspan class=\"en\">freezing</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 凝固</tspan></text><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"56\" r=\"40\" class=\"pt-c\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"pt-t\">GAS</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">气体</text><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"262\" r=\"40\" class=\"pt-c\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"pt-t\">SOLID</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"277\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">固体</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"262\" r=\"40\" class=\"pt-c\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"pt-t\">LIQUID</text><text x=\"410\" y=\"277\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">液体</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The six phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变</span></div><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Particles in the three states</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">三种状态中的粒子</span></span></p><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 245\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"particles in solid, liquid and gas\"><defs><marker id=\"mvh\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"mvh\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">SOLID</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 固体</tspan></text><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s en\">fixed shape & volume</text><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">形状体积固定</text><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><rect x=\"195\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">LIQUID</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 液体</tspan></text><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s en\">fixed volume, takes shape</text><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">体积固定、形状随容器</text><circle cx=\"249\" cy=\"93\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"87\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"274\" cy=\"108\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"119\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"89\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"261\" cy=\"142\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"285\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"85\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"103\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"132\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"214\" cy=\"145\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"311\" cy=\"154\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"327\" cy=\"129\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"237\" cy=\"151\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"114\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><text x=\"445.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">GAS</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 气体</tspan></text><text x=\"445.0\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s en\">fills the container</text><text x=\"445.0\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">充满容器</text><circle cx=\"415\" cy=\"86\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"395\" y2=\"108\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"459\" cy=\"115\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"463\" y1=\"127\" x2=\"469\" y2=\"143\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"464\" cy=\"52\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"462\" y1=\"39\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"22\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"405\" cy=\"139\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"409\" y1=\"151\" x2=\"414\" y2=\"168\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"499\" cy=\"104\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"512\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"529\" y2=\"106\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"395\" cy=\"50\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"32\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"487\" cy=\"152\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"475\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"165\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The six phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sublimation vs deposition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">升华与凝华</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Both skip the liquid, so students swap them.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两者都跳过液态，学生常常搞反。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Find the START state.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">找出起始状态。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Starts solid → sublimation. Starts gas → deposition.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">从固体开始 → 升华；从气体开始 → 凝华。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How many of the six phase changes skip the liquid state?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变中有几种跳过液态？</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">2 (sublimation and deposition).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">2 种（升华和凝华）。</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The six phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六种相变</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Frost = freezing ✗ → frost = deposition (vapour → ice) ✓</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">霜＝凝固 ✗ → 霜＝凝华（水蒸气 → 冰）✓</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tnote\">🟡 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Your class diagram names liquid → gas \"evaporation\". Many textbooks call it \"vaporization\" and split it into evaporation (at the surface, below the boiling point) and boiling (throughout the liquid, at the boiling point). On this test, \"evaporation\" is the expected name; on the heating curve, the flat step at 100 °C is called \"boiling\".</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">课堂笔记的三角图把「液 → 气」叫做「汽化（evaporation）」。很多教科书称之为 vaporization，并细分为表面汽化（低于沸点）和沸腾（整个液体内部、在沸点）。本次考试答「evaporation 汽化」即可；加热曲线上 100 °C 的平台则叫「沸腾」。</span></div></div><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Write \"start → end\" in states first; the name follows from the triangle.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">先写「起始状态 → 最终状态」，名字从三角图上读出来。</span></div></div>"}], "cards": [{"id": "c5-phase-changes.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solid → gas directly?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体直接变气体？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sublimation (e.g. dry ice).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">升华（例：干冰）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas → solid directly?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体直接变固体？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Deposition (e.g. frost).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凝华（例：霜）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas → liquid?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体变液体？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Condensation (e.g. steam on a mirror).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液化（凝结），例：镜子上的水汽。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid → gas (class name)?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体变气体（课堂用名）？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Evaporation (boiling when it happens at the boiling point).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汽化（在沸点发生时叫沸腾）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical or chemical: any phase change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相变是物理还是化学变化？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Always physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一律是物理变化。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.c5", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which three absorb energy?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪三种吸收能量？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Melting, evaporation, sublimation (toward gas).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔化、汽化、升华（朝气态方向）。</span></div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "c5-phase-changes.p1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A solid turning directly into a gas is called ______.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体直接变成气体叫做______。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Dry ice does this.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">干冰就会这样。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">sublimation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">升华</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solid → gas = sublimation.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固 → 气＝升华。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.p2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas turning into liquid is called ______.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体变成液体叫做______。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The opposite of evaporation.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汽化的反方向。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">condensation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液化（凝结）</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas → liquid = condensation.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气 → 液＝液化（凝结）。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.p3", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Name the change: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.622em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.511em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">说出变化名称：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.622em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.511em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">(l) = liquid, (s) = solid.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">(l)＝液体，(s)＝固体。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">freezing</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凝固</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid → solid = freezing.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液 → 固＝凝固。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.p4", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Frost forms on grass on a clear, cold night without dew forming first. This is:</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">晴朗寒冷的夜晚，草上直接结霜，之前没有先结露。这是：</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">freezing</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凝固</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">condensation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液化（凝结）</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">sublimation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">升华</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">deposition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凝华</span></span>"], "a": 3, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Where did the water come from — liquid or vapour?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">水是从哪来的——液体还是水蒸气？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">deposition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凝华</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Water vapour (gas) → ice (solid) with no liquid in between → deposition.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">水蒸气（气）→ 冰（固），中间没有液态 → 凝华。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.p5", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Mothballs in a closet slowly get smaller over months, but there is never any liquid. Which phase change is happening?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">衣柜里的樟脑丸几个月里慢慢变小，但从来没有出现过液体。发生的是哪种相变？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solid to ? without passing through liquid.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体变成什么，并且没经过液体？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">sublimation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">升华</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The solid becomes gas directly (you can smell it) with no liquid → sublimation.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体直接变成气体（能闻到气味），没有液体 → 升华。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.p6", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which group lists the three phase changes in which the substance ABSORBS energy?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪一组列出的三种相变都需要「吸收」能量？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting, evaporation, sublimation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔化、汽化、升华</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">freezing, condensation, deposition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凝固、液化、凝华</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting, freezing, condensation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔化、凝固、液化</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">sublimation, deposition, evaporation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">升华、凝华、汽化</span></span>"], "a": 0, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">On the heating curve heat is ADDED for melting and boiling; the reverse changes give heat back.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">加热曲线上熔化和沸腾都要加热；反过来的变化会放出热量。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting, evaporation, sublimation</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔化、汽化、升华</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Melting, evaporation, sublimation all move toward a more spread-out state, so energy must be absorbed to separate the particles.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔化、汽化、升华都朝更松散的状态变化，需要吸收能量来分开粒子。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c5-phase-changes.p7", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A cold can of pop is taken out of the fridge. Within minutes, drops of water cover the outside of the can. (a) Where does the water come from? (b) Name the phase change. (c) Is it physical or chemical? Justify.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">从冰箱拿出一罐冷饮，几分钟内罐子外面布满水珠。(a) 水从哪来？(b) 说出相变名称。(c) 是物理变化还是化学变化？说明理由。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The can is sealed. What in the air contains water?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">罐子是密封的。空气里有什么含有水？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">(a) Water vapour in the air. (b) Condensation. (c) Physical — it is still <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span>, only the phase changed.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">(a) 空气中的水蒸气。(b) 液化（凝结）。(c) 物理变化——仍是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，只是相变了。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Air contains water vapour. When it touches the cold can, it cools and turns into liquid drops.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">空气中含有水蒸气，碰到冰冷的罐子后冷却，变成液态水珠。</span></div>", "whys": null}], "v": 1, "key": "topic-c5-phase-changes"}